{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方第一块大号白字和紫色强调词，位置靠上、亮度高、字号最大，首先吸引视线。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他没藏住喜欢，被对方看出自己有多在乎。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"空落落、担心被嫌太黏。\",\n  \"missed\": \"交谈突然停止、怀疑这份幸福是否真实，以及亲近时像隔了一层的微妙变化；底部“像终于能深吸一口气”的补充也不容易第一眼注意到。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"上下两块大号文字都很显眼，第一块之后还需要转移视线到第二块。\",\n    \"核心处境主要在上方，核心感受主要在下方，两者的关系需要跨块拼接。\",\n    \"两个主文字块本身都较长，各自包含不止一层意思。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e746e2b6-fd37-4d7f-b827-0e439c20da4a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T011125017745Z", "elapsed_seconds": 33.141, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:11:58.155140+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f8c0a600ee60d9997b5065024b4c5815574e7843aa0fed51ddb2af9bf3c41485", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa2